/-!
# `Dispatcher`: witnesses, wrong-function battery, refutations (Phase 7, track P7D)

Heavy root (decision 55): the kernel runs are in `Proofs/Phase7/DispatcherRuns/R*.lean` (one run
each, checked in chunks from literal states; generated by `tools/DispRuns/gen.py`). This module
derives the theorems from their observations (`R*.obs`). User programs: `IO.pure(())` (`p`),
`IO.cede` (`c`), `IO.sleep(1)`; no user function (`u`); map order `id`; worker choices none
(worker 0); schedule FIFO (`[]`) unless named (`sched 14 300`, `sched 50 300`).

| Statement | Witness (`v = 0`) | Wrong variants (`¬ XV v`) |
|---|---|---|
| `dispRunsOnce` | R01: one start | 4 (R04), 12 (R13) |
| `dispAwaitDrains` | R01 (`sequential`) | 1 (R02), 3 (R03), 13 (R05, R18), 16 (R06), 9 (R11), 11 (R12) |
| `dispNoLostSubmission` | R34 (`sequential`: the late submission throws) | refuted (CE-0090, R32); twin 32 (R33) |
| `dispClosedRejects` | R23 | 19 (R24) |
| `dispSeqFifo` | R25 (order `[0, 1]`) | 18 (R26, two tasks at once) |
| `dispCancels` | R27 (canceled, status 3) | 20 (R28) |
| `dispNoDeadlock` | R01, R21 (with a cancel) | 2 (R07), 6 (R22), 10 (R14), 14 (R08, R19), 15 (R09, R20) |
| `dispCancelStops` | R29 | 5 (R30), 7 (R31) |

`dispAwaitDrains` is refuted (CE-0091, R15: `parallel(await = true)`, FIFO); fixed twin 31 (R16).
-/

namespace CatsEffectInLean.Proofs.Phase7.DispatcherBattery

